{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_st02","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_st02","title":"切开","storyCode":"IS-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"4732c70b6c8ee5713937a05305662035e88833048177ae7754bd4f238de9549c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"拉普兰德代替德克萨斯入狱，莱昂图索见到了狼之主，空发现之前有过交流的女观众就是《德克萨斯之死》的作者。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激进的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我从来没听说过这事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没有听说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激进的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，是她的独断专行......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我默许了她的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激进的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷！您原本就有这样的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪中送炭和锦上添花 ，你选哪一种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内想要一手遮天，哼，哪有那么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果承担一点骂名就能从贝纳尔多身上割一块肉下来，那又有何妨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我们现在应该怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"备车，我要去见一见我的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，丹布朗现在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗？他似乎在一家洗车店工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把地址给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要把他召回来......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有同意过他离开家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，准备一场宴会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宴请贝洛内少爷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下，根据拉普兰德提供的线索，我们抓到了这两个杀手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过指认，他们确实参与了针对莱昂图索的刺杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们两个认识她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，拉普兰德，我就知道跟你扯上关系绝对不会有好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在叙拉古坐牢，难道不是一种新奇的体验吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他们两个关起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你在现场拖住了切利尼娜，并且派人用炸弹炸死了卡拉奇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是坚持这个供词吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真多疑啊，法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，对贝洛内来说，快点结案不都是一件好事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，还是德克萨斯，有区别吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，法官小姐，你该把我处死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是一个被家族除名的弃子而已，你努力一下应该是能做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想象一下，我的死能够给叙拉古的司法公正带来多么正面的影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这难道不值得你来尝试吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你究竟想做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果你真的是凶手，我会这么做的，拉普兰德·萨卢佐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，现在，我还要去见一个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领，您回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去休息吧，这段时间，你也辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不服气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒想知道，我要怎样才能服气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情，是时候让你知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g9_conferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么带我来这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吾主。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多，你教不会你的幼崽，现在想让我来帮你驯服他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是需要理解一些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是狼之主，幼崽。"},{"type":"narration","text":"在听到狼之主三个字的瞬间，莱昂图索感到了一阵眩晕。\n大量的信息与琐碎的片段在一瞬间灌入他的脑海。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"narration","text":"狼之主，“兽主”。\n不同于这片大地上的一切生物，他们从未诞生，他们只是显示他们的存在。\n扎罗，是从狼群中走来的兽主。\n他与他的同胞们站在荒野上见证了狼群的一切足迹。\n他们遵循着本性，进行着永无止境的厮杀。\n狼之主不死不灭，兽之主不死不灭。\n同类之间的厮杀无法令他们得到满足。于是，狼之主们制定了一个游戏规则。\n内容很简单，每一头狼之主挑选一个人类来培养，再由人类相互狩猎。\n这些人，被称作獠牙。\n而拥有不曾折断的獠牙的狼之主，就是头狼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g9_conferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狼之主，狩猎，獠牙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父亲，是我最为满意的獠牙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥，阿尔贝托先生今天要宴请贝洛内家族的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备好上好的食材送过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道说，真的是萨卢佐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想，既然要宴请的是贝洛内家族，光是上好的食材怎么够呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请转告阿尔贝托先生，我愿意亲自上门为两大家族料理这顿晚宴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道阿尔贝托先生意下如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomB"},{"type":"narration","text":"在哥伦比亚，一个家族成员如果对人施以善意，那么，这个施以善意的对象，往往最终会成为一场交易的筹码。\n越在乎，越昂贵。\n而在叙拉古，这个对象最终可能会死在某个雨夜之中。\n越在乎，越痛苦。\n最终，你最好成为一个冷酷无情的人。\n德克萨斯在无比了解这一点的同时，厌恶这一点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要向我道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你现在想离开，只需要稍微办个手续，我可以让你离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"程序上，你的嫌疑已经被洗清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我发现，在监狱里可能还要清净一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不打算放弃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，你的老朋友真的是凶手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么做是她的风格，但是，我看不到她这么做的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就还不到我放弃的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅小姐，罗塞蒂家族派人过来，说是瓦拉赫先生要请切利尼娜小姐叙一叙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来，我也不能继续休息了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"当德克萨斯经过自己时，拉维妮娅感觉到自己的口袋中被塞了一样东西。\n她拿出来，发现是一张纸条。\n纸条上写着一个号码，角落还写着几个字——\n企鹅物流，风雨无阻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，先生，如果你要睡觉的话，能不能至少不要把腿翘起来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是你还有谁？你怎么能在剧院这样的地方睡觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且你把脚翘得这么高，太不文雅了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该没有影响到你看这个什么歌舞剧吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没有，但是身边有你这样不雅的家伙在，非常影响我欣赏这部戏剧的心情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我把腿收起来就行了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你、你还随身带了吃的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......小伙子，剧院里应该是没有提供食物贩卖的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这里居然不卖爆米花，我从附近的便利店买的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你第一次来这种场所吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我有一个朋友推荐我来这里放松心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得......演出如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里看了半天，也没有看懂台上到底在演什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们为什么要演这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"把这个小伙子请出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不欢迎他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我买了票的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧院经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"把票钱退给他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我们走吧，先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"滚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这么一说，我在开演的时候就见过这家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还以为是谁家的有钱人来体验生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到居然真是个根本不懂歌舞剧的穷酸鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们觉得台上的演出很有意思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，当然有意思，演员们多好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还有那些歌曲，多么动听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......所谓的艺术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你这种家伙，还是去酒吧里买醉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，差点忘了，你的票钱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"可别说我们贪了你的钱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还敢反抗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这家伙，力气还挺大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，快来帮忙啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙的眼神，不对劲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊啊啊！我的手，我的手要断了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......你、你给我等着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，算了，他也只是捡个钱，跟一个穷酸鬼计较什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我给你包扎一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉维妮娅小姐，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我并不能理解这种娱乐方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，我还是应该找个酒吧买醉，然后去成人影院度过夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要喝酒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"丹布朗循声望去，看到一个男子靠在巷子边的墙上。\n他旁若无人地向自己摇了摇手中的酒瓶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomA"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，给我一个解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不就是你想要的结果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在贝洛内最虚弱的时候去帮助他们，掌控他们，最后支配他们，而不是消灭他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该教过你，拉普兰德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种时候，你应该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我忘了，毕竟，我已经离开这个家很多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以容忍你许多事，你可以没有完成我交给你的事情，也可以违背我的意愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你终究是我的女儿，拉普兰德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以给你这样的宽容，但你不能越过我为这个家族做决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我承认，你确实猜中了我的心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我是这个家族的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前，你做了这样的事，被我逐出家门。而这次，你又故技重施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明知道这样会触怒我，你甚至知道，你只有这样做会触怒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，我的女儿，告诉我，你为什么要这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为除此之外，我感受不到一点乐趣，我的父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要知道，对你来说，是不是一家之主的位置高于一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直想要知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德从地上挣扎着爬起来。\n她露出了欢快的笑容，就好像，她是为了体会这一刻而回到了叙拉古。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，时间到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天就先这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不继续吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实违抗了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你又确实是我的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比所有人都了解我的心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是缺少一些管教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我教育的失败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们还有很多时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，所有狼之主都生活在我们之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他是所有狼之主中，唯一一个与人类社会有联系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的狼之主依然生活在荒野之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他认为，人类的权力，也是一种力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用这份力量战胜其他狼之主，亦是一种胜利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，他要你推翻西西里夫人，以此成为掌握叙拉古真正权力的那个人，然后来帮他赢得所谓的同族之间的厮杀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，我，甚至这个家族，都是他用来获胜的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我能够接受这个理由？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己就能接受吗！一辈子当一个傀儡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你搞错了一件事，莱昂，我的儿子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他教会我如何去攫取权力，正如我教会你的那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，运用权力，为他打败其他狼之主的獠牙只是一环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一路上做的每一个决策，乃至在此时此刻出手，都是我自己的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你怎么能够确定这是你自己的意志？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不......他是认真的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是啊，如果一个人真的是傀儡，那他绝不会有父亲这样的气质。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们互为工具，互相许诺最终的胜利，仅此而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"首领，萨卢佐家族的邀请函到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔贝托先生设宴，邀请莱昂少爷前去一叙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，我已经数不清你今天叹了多少次气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法呀，毕竟法庭上发生了那样的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，我们去劫狱吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你傻啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少能见她一面也是好的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是放弃这个念头比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特琳娜小姐，你怎么会在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我要问的，空小姐，这一带可不安全，你们怎么在这里散步聊天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我住在这附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你难道是被人骗了才住在这里的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我和能天使在，放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，这是谁啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这是我前几天在剧院那边认识的卡特琳娜小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......看来你有可靠的朋友，那就好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特琳娜小姐呢，你又是为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不必担心我，对我来说，这样嘈杂的地方，更加适合创作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"创作......咦，我记得，《德克萨斯之死》的作者也叫卡特琳娜，难道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？！难怪你会对德克萨斯家族有关的事这么了解！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这个剧本我也读过了，就算是我也看得出是很厉害的剧本！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，卡特琳娜小姐，能不能给我签个名！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，虽然这个名字现在还并不值钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信《德克萨斯之死》一定会大卖的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"比起这个，你刚才说的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看起来有些身手，如果是其他叙拉古城市的监狱，或许你们真的能闯一闯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，沃尔西尼毕竟有拉维妮娅这样的人存在，想要进去也没有那么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且现在所有家族的眼光都聚集在那里，轻举妄动是会出事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我们只是在开玩笑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你们的眼神，可不像是在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以问一个问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......对切利尼娜很了解吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，在过去，艺术界有一个不成文的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以创作一些和家族有关的东西，但你永远不能直接提到家族的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是现在，《德克萨斯之死》却堂而皇之地出现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这将是第一部，直接用上存在过的家族名的作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这意味着，家族们不再避讳自己的身份，他们甚至渴望着走上舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这一切，都是哥伦比亚人的功劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，自从哥伦比亚人开始介入叙拉古的艺术界，许多东西就开始变味了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了赚到更多的钱，一些没有底线的艺术家——哦，现在或许叫他们手工艺人更加合适，他们的作品也开始变得臭不可闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再观察生活，而是创造一种虚假的生活，只要那是一种让观众愿意付钱的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再积淀，而是对流行文化进行拼贴。什么东西昨天开始流行，明天你可能就会在剧院里见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到最后，那些真正优秀的作品将会被淹没，而这些垃圾，将会成为你所能见到的一切所谓艺术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一件很可怕的事情，你不觉得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果所有人都喜欢这种东西，那你所谓的艺术，就应该被扔掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实是一种论调，可是，并不是所有人都这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有想要让那些佳作不被埋没的人，只是他们不知道该如何抵抗这股潮流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算是过去的歌舞剧，我也欣赏不来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你无疑没有走出过往的时光，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文索内希俄斯，你可以在《沃尔西尼艺术周刊》的一些评论区看到我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我文就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......对现在的叙拉古感到怀疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人物们说，我们应该用更加文明的方式来解决问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，当我想要试着以文明的方式做某些事情时，真正发生的，却和过去毫无区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，我们可以不这么做，为什么却要欺骗自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为家族们或多或少感觉到了这是大势所趋，但没有人愿意放弃自己已经获得的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝一杯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这瓶酒，我印象里很贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里是一家廉价的披萨店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫无疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你要用这样的酒，配这样的披萨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为，对我来说，这瓶酒的价值，和这块披萨的价值，是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这瓶酒的酿造工艺确实不错，但构成这片披萨的小麦，却也是经过精心照料的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们之间的价值真的相差如此之多？其中当真不含名为文明的矫饰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......文明的矫饰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像这瓶酒的标签，仿佛贴上它，你就可以打着文明的旗号，对受你欺骗的人巧取豪夺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜原来逃到了龙门生活，而你们竟然就是她的朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，可能你很难相信吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我相信你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，你们没有必要骗我，其次，我也一直相信，她可能还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照你们的说法，我反而可以理解，她为什么会忽然出现在这座城市了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕，当年的清算中，她和贝洛内有所交易，而现在，她要来还债了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......这确实像是她的作风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，好巧不巧，你们居然找到了白日剧团......（低声）不，甚至可能不是巧合吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，白日剧团怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想通过演艺事业接近贝洛内家族，白日剧团确实是一个正确的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......对了，跟我来吧，几位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是我的住所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，到处都是书和纸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不好意思，因为是一时起意，我也来不及打扫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐，给你这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"这是钥匙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，外面比较危险，你要是想要找个地方练习的话，不如来我这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有许多剧本可以给你参考，这里也更安静一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，就当交个朋友，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
